  "bodyHash": "7adb5dc46f8e354d",
  "content": "<p>为服务器添加了许多必不可少的实用命令：</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>请在此处查看文档：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdocs-essentials\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/docs-essentials</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>杂项命令：</p>\n<p>/kickme - 将自己踢出服务器（以防床bug再次出现）</p>\n<p>/trashcan - 打开一个物品栏，将物品放入并关闭后会将其删除</p>\n<p>/leaderboard - 尚未实现</p>\n<p>/rec - 尚未实现</p>\n<p>/hat - 将主手当前物品放置到头盔槽位，使其成为你的“帽子”</p>\n<p>/nick &lt;name…&gt; - 更改聊天中的昵称</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>作弊命令：</p>\n<p>/heal - 将玩家生命值和精神值恢复到满状态</p>\n<p>/fly - 切换飞行模式</p>\n<p>/god - 尚未实现</p>\n<p>/invsee &lt;player&gt; - 允许查看和编辑其他玩家的物品栏</p>\n<p>/nickfor &lt;player&gt; &lt;name…&gt; - 更改其他玩家在聊天中的昵称</p>\n<p>/mute - 静音某玩家</p>\n<p>/unmute - 取消对某玩家的静音</p>\n<p>/teleport_last &lt;player&gt; - 传送至该玩家最后已知位置</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>传送命令：</p>\n<p>/back - 传送至上一个位置。可多次使用</p>\n<p>/spawn - 将你传送至出生点</p>\n<p>/rtp - 将你传送至世界中的随机位置，尝试寻找非海洋且安全的着陆点</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>/home [name] - 传送至家园</p>\n<p>/sethome &lt;name&gt; - 设置家园</p>\n<p>/delhome &lt;name&gt; - 删除家园</p>\n<p>/listhomes [player] - 列出所有玩家的家园</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>/warp &lt;name&gt; - 传送至传送点</p>\n<p>/setwarp &lt;name&gt; - 设置传送点</p>\n<p>/delwarp &lt;name&gt; - 删除传送点</p>\n<p>/listwarps - 列出所有传送点</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>/tpa &lt;player&gt; - 请求传送到该玩家处</p>\n<p>/tpahere &lt;player&gt; - 请求该玩家传送到你这里</p>\n<p>/tpaccept &lt;id&gt; - 接受请求（屏幕上会有按钮供点击）</p>\n<p>/tpadeny &lt;id&gt; - 拒绝请求（屏幕上会有按钮供点击）</p>\n<h2>支持</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>关于<strong>整合包</strong>的问题，请访问： <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-modpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-modpack</a></li>\n<li>关于<strong>模组</strong>的问题，请访问： <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-mod-issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-mod-issues</a></li>\n<li>有任何问题？欢迎加入我们的 Discord：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/discord</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>保持关注</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-discord.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fgithub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-github.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitter-x.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fyoutube\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-youtube.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitch.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252finstagram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-instagram.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ffacebook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-facebook.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftiktok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-tiktok.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
